# The grind press is remembered for grind.bufferTicks (14 since phase 24): the low ledge's grind
# (lab-5050-ledge) is first in reach on tick 168, and a press 13 ticks (108 ms) before it still
# catches it. With the old 10 ticks it had to come within 83 ms. lab-grind-too-early: 14 ticks misses.
park lab
cmd 0 teleport 0 -0.6 0.14 90
hold up 6..100
hold ollie 90..105
tap grind 155
bot balance
run 480
expect event grindStart{trick=BS 50-50,slide=false} within 169..169
expect no event bail
